          "text": "The pattern indexes as a rhombohedral **delafossite-type** structure in space group **\\(R\\bar{3}m\\) (No. 166)**, using the hexagonal setting. The low-angle reflections are 003 and 006; the refined cell is approximately \\(a=3.8515\\) \u00c5 and \\(c=21.842\\) \u00c5. Hg is linearly coordinated, while Ni occupies an octahedral site.\n\n```cif\ndata_NiHgS2\n_audit_creation_method               'Indexed and refined from supplied Cu Kalpha1 powder pattern'\n_chemical_name_common                'nickel mercury sulfide'\n_chemical_formula_structural         'NiHgS2'\n_chemical_formula_sum                'Hg1 Ni1 S2'\n_cell_formula_units_Z                3\n\n_cell_length_a                       3.8515(5)\n_cell_length_b                       3.8515(5)\n_cell_length_c                       21.842(3)\n_cell_angle_alpha                    90\n_cell_angle_beta                     90\n_cell_angle_gamma                    120\n_cell_volume                         280.60\n\n_space_group_name_H-M_alt            'R -3 m'\n_space_group_IT_number               166\n_space_group_crystal_system          trigonal\n\n_diffrn_radiation_type               'Cu Kalpha1'\n_diffrn_radiation_wavelength         1.5406\n_exptl_crystal_density_diffrn        5.74\n\nloop_\n_atom_type_symbol\n_atom_type_number_in_cell\nHg 3\nNi 3\nS  6\n\nloop_\n_atom_site_label\n_atom_site_type_symbol\n_atom_site_symmetry_multiplicity\n_atom_site_Wyckoff_symbol\n_atom_site_fract_x\n_atom_site_fract_y\n_atom_site_fract_z\n_atom_site_occupancy\nHg1 Hg 3 a 0 0 0       1\nNi1 Ni 3 b 0 0 0.5     1\nS1  S  6 c 0 0 0.1100  1\n```\n\nRepresentative indexing:\n\n| \\(hkl\\) | Calculated/observed \\(2\\theta\\) |\n|---|---:|\n| 003 | 12.15\u00b0 |\n| 006 | 24.43\u00b0 |\n| 101 | 27.02\u00b0 |\n| 012 | 27.95\u00b0 |\n| 104 | 31.40\u00b0 |\n| 015 | 33.78\u00b0 |\n| 009 | 37.01\u00b0 |\n| 107 | 39.52\u00b0 |\n| 018 | 42.76\u00b0 |\n| 110 | 47.16\u00b0 |\n\nThe sulfur coordinate is estimated as \\(z\\appro